        <DependsOn><T-006 /></DependsOn>
        <AcceptanceCriteria>
          <Criterion>Every mandatory check succeeds on one unchanged P1 PR head.</Criterion>
          <Criterion>Squash merge is followed by successful post-merge CI and a separate archive-only applied transition.</Criterion>
